# large / transient build + run artifacts — never committed
.build/
.check/
.containerignore
.dockerignore
media/
output/
capture/
*.bak*
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.rollup-cache.json

# large binary artifacts — a TYPE-level safety net so a disk image / recording /
# screenshot can never be committed even if it lands OUTSIDE the dirs above
# (the dir patterns cover media/ + output/, these cover a stray path).
*.qcow2
*.qcow
*.iso
*.raw
*.img
*.vmdk
*.vdi
*.mp4
*.mjpeg
*.m4v
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.avi
*.gif
*.cast
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# Deliberately NOT ignored (tracked as the lane produces them) so a fresh clone
# can rerun every eval and read every result:
#   pr-beds/                 the generated per-PR eval config (oracle-authored beds)
#   metrics/                 the per-PR lane metrics
#   stage-findings.yml       the per-run lane ledger dump
#   setup-defects/           the improvement ledger (the self-improving loop's memory)
#   eval/omarchy-acceptance-matrix.md  the generated acceptance-corpus matrix
